          <StxLink class="flex flex-col gap-[0.2rem] px-[0.72rem] py-[0.62rem] hover:bg-[var(--surface-2)] rounded-[var(--r-sm)]" role="menuitem" to="/features/stack-traces"><span class="font-semibold text-[0.9rem] text-ink tracking-[-0.01em]">Readable stack traces</span><span class="leading-[1.4] text-[0.8rem] text-subtle">Source maps turn minified frames back into your code.</span></StxLink>
          <StxLink class="flex flex-col gap-[0.2rem] px-[0.72rem] py-[0.62rem] hover:bg-[var(--surface-2)] rounded-[var(--r-sm)]" role="menuitem" to="/features/grouping"><span class="font-semibold text-[0.9rem] text-ink tracking-[-0.01em]">Fingerprint grouping</span><span class="leading-[1.4] text-[0.8rem] text-subtle">Identical errors fold into one issue with a live count.</span></StxLink>
